<view class="container">
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{warehouse}}">
    <view class="section-title">我的日本仓地址</view>
    <view style="line-height: 1.6;">{{warehouse.address}}</view>
    <view style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
      会员代码：<text style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 32rpx;">{{warehouse.member_code}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint" style="margin: 6rpx 0 0;">
      寄件时务必把会员代码写在快递单上，否则仓库认不出是谁的包裹
    </view>
    <view class="muted">{{warehouse.note}}</view>
    <button class="btn-outline" style="margin-top: 20rpx;" bindtap="onCopyAddress">复制收货地址</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card row">
    <button class="btn-primary" style="width: 45%;" bindtap="goForecast">+ 预报包裹</button>
    <button class="btn-outline" style="width: 45%;" bindtap="goPackages">查看我的包裹</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">运费计算器</view>
    <view class="row">
      <input class="input" style="flex: 1; margin-right: 16rpx;" type="digit" placeholder="包裹重量(kg)"
        value="{{weightInput}}" bindinput="onWeightInput" />
      <button class="btn-outline" bindtap="onEstimateFee">计算</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{feeResult}}" wx:key="line_id" style="padding: 16rpx 0; border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f0f0;">
      <view class="row">
        <view style="font-weight: 600;">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view style="color: #2b6cff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 32rpx;">¥{{item.fee}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.fee_detail}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.value_range}} · {{item.days_min}}-{{item.days_max}}天</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{feeResult.length}}" style="margin: 16rpx 0 0;">
      两条线的区别在申报价值，不在重量。价值超过范围会卡在海关，下单时系统会自动提醒。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" bindtap="goMineForService">
    <view class="row">
      <view>
        <view>有问题？联系客服</view>
        <view class="muted">运费线下结算，加客服微信沟通</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{notices.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">公告</view>
    <view wx:for="{{notices}}" wx:key="id" style="margin-bottom: 12rpx;">
      <view style="font-weight: 600;">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.content}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
